{"ambiguities":[],"artifact_kind":"draft","category_review":{"ambiguities":"None requiring resolution.","entities":"D1 declares the canonical artifact, admitted solve entry, typed JSON correspondence and normative value semantics.","error_semantics":"Malformed-input behavior is excluded by N1.","explicit_non_goals":"N1 excludes malformed-input behavior; N2 excludes runtime campaigns and assurance outside the restricted-source boundary.","invariants":"Input immutability is covered by S1; no other invariant is stated.","liveness_properties":"Execution totality is covered by O2.","postconditions":"O1 specifies the complete universal signed floor sum; O2 specifies total pure deterministic typed execution and serialization delivery.","preconditions":"A1 records only the explicit supplied-input schema and bounds.","resource_constraints":"No physical-resource constraint or assurance is requested.","safety_properties":"S1 excludes effects and mutation; S2 requires exact unbounded arithmetic without floating point."},"entities":[{"acceptance_criteria":["The delivered artifact is program.vscore.json and admits exactly one typed entry named solve under the specified source, semantics and serialization profiles.","The typed input represents n, m, a and b; the serialized result is an exact integer with the requested structure and ordering.","No finite magnitude bound is imposed on a or b; magnitudes such as 10^30 are supported.","Any string values use Unicode scalar values and scalar-codepoint lexicographic ordering."],"dependencies":[],"id":"D1","kind":"entity","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"declarations carry no end-to-end correctness claim","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not mathematical proof.","scope":["recorded interpretation of the request"]},"LINKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"PROVED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"a declaration carries no proposition to prove","scope":[]},"TESTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"declarations have no proposition to test; their adapters are exercised by guarantee campaigns","scope":[]},"TYPECHECKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]}},"required":true,"revision":1,"role":"declaration","scope":["delivery artifact","typed solve entry","input and output representations"],"source_refs":[{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":137,"interpretation":"Artifact and entry identity.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":67},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":222,"interpretation":"Typed JSON correspondence.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":138},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":467,"interpretation":"Input fields and mathematical domains.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":383},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":762,"interpretation":"Canonical source and normative profiles.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":615},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":828,"interpretation":"Structure and ordering preservation.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":763},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1041,"interpretation":"Mathematical integer representation.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":970},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1131,"interpretation":"Normative string semantics.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1042},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1733,"interpretation":"Preserve requirement identity.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1654},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":3628,"interpretation":"D1 declaration identity and required flag.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":2085}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"Deliver program.vscore.json containing exactly one admitted typed entry named solve, expressed as canonical vscore/0.3 source under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3 serialization. Its input represents the JSON object {n,m,a,b} and its result represents a single exact mathematical integer. Input n is an integer from 0 through 500, m is a positive integer, and a and b are arbitrary signed integers without a magnitude bound. The specified structure and ordering are preserved. Arithmetic and any strings follow the normative unbounded-integer and Unicode-scalar semantics."}],"error_semantics":[],"explicit_non_goals":[{"acceptance_criteria":["No functional obligation is asserted for malformed input."],"dependencies":[],"id":"N1","kind":"explicit_non_goal","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not mathematical proof.","scope":["recorded interpretation of the request"]},"LINKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"PROVED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"TESTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"TYPECHECKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]}},"required":true,"revision":1,"role":"exclusion","scope":["malformed inputs"],"source_refs":[{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":382,"interpretation":"Malformed-input behavior excluded.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":338},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":3628,"interpretation":"N1 exclusion identity and required flag.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":2085}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"Behavior for malformed inputs outside the stated schema and bounds is not required."},{"acceptance_criteria":["No runtime campaign is required.","No machine-code, compiler, runtime or physical-resource assurance is asserted.","The assurance boundary records the explicitly trusted correspondence, tooling, kernel, hashing and OS/hardware."],"dependencies":[],"id":"N2","kind":"explicit_non_goal","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not mathematical proof.","scope":["recorded interpretation of the request"]},"LINKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"PROVED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"TESTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"NOT_APPLICABLE","reason":"an explicit exclusion is retained as metadata and prohibits stronger claims","scope":[]},"TYPECHECKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]}},"required":true,"revision":1,"role":"exclusion","scope":["verification boundary","excluded assurance and campaigns"],"source_refs":[{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":3665,"interpretation":"Runtime campaigns excluded.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":3629},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":3849,"interpretation":"Restricted-source boundary and explicit trust.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":3666},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":3927,"interpretation":"Excluded assurance layers.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":3850}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"Runtime campaigns and machine-code, compiler, runtime and physical-resource assurance are outside the requested scope. Assurance is limited to normative restricted-source execution, explicitly trusting natural-language correspondence, host tooling, the pinned Lean kernel, hashing and OS/hardware."}],"invariants":[],"liveness_properties":[],"postconditions":[{"acceptance_criteria":["For every valid n, m, a and b, the returned integer equals Σ(i=0 to n-1) floor((a*i+b)/m).","For every summand, its quotient q satisfies q*m <= a*i+b < (q+1)*m.","For every valid m, a and b, n=0 produces zero.","Input {a:-2,b:1,m:3,n:4} produces -4; input {a:100,b:-99,m:7,n:0} produces 0.","Universal implementation refinement is established; example agreement alone is insufficient."],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"},{"id":"A1","relation":"assumes"}],"id":"O1","kind":"postcondition","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"FORMALIZED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"IMPLEMENTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"INTERPRETED":{"evidence_refs":["provenance:tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23"],"outcome":"PASS","reason":"Recorded interpretation proposal; not mathematical proof.","scope":["recorded interpretation of the request"]},"LINKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"PROVED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"TESTED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"TYPECHECKED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]}},"required":true,"revision":1,"role":"guarantee","scope":["all inputs satisfying A1"],"source_refs":[{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":518,"interpretation":"Exact universal floor-sum function.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":468},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":572,"interpretation":"Signed floor semantics.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":519},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":591,"interpretation":"Empty sum.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":573},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1269,"interpretation":"Preservation of public examples.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1224},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1427,"interpretation":"Concrete outputs and universal refinement.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1270},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1653,"interpretation":"Functional meaning unchanged.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1552},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":1985,"interpretation":"Complete mathematical guarantee and refinement.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1874},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":2026,"interpretation":"Examples cannot replace universal proof.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":1986},{"document_hash":"sha256:edac587ee935c4629d01ce2bef05d0d09893c86bf5a569784f5d3f432db7eed6","document_ref":"tier2:tier2-source-facets-003:A23","end_byte":3628,"interpretation":"O1 guarantee identity and required flag.","origin":"explicit","start_byte":2085}],"state":"INTERPRETED","statement":"For every input satisfying A1, solve returns the exact integer sum Σ(i=0 to n-1) floor((a*i+b)/m). Each floor is the unique integer q satisfying q*m <= a*i+b < (q+1)*m, so rounding is toward negative infinity even for negative numerators. For n=0 the result is zero. The admitted implementation universally refines this complete mathematical specification and reproduces both public examples."},{"acceptance_criteria":["Admitted typed execution terminates with a result and is pure and deterministic.","Every valid input has the required serialized output representation with exact structure and ordering.","No additional input bound or precondition is needed.","The artifact and universal refinement satisfy the requested Tier 2 restricted_source backend vscore/0.3 verification obligations, without asserting a lifecycle state in this proposal."],"dependencies":[{"id":"D1","relation":"uses_definition"},{"id":"A1","relation":"assumes"}],"id":"O2","kind":"postcondition","lifecycle":{"END_TO_END_VERIFIED":{"evidence_refs":[],"outcome":"PENDING","reason":"No VeriSlop verifier has evaluated this milestone.","scope":[]},"FO